    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"1. input() 函数：弹出输入提示框，等待用户在控制台输入一个数字\\n\",\n",
    "    \"注意：用户输入的内容会以字符串类型返回，这是python唯一的输入格式\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"2eb86cc1b4e5984a\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"source\": \"input(\\\"please enter a number: \\\")\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"e6a86da0b53ab004\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"2. print() 函数：在控制台直接输出字符串 \\\"helloworld_1\\\"，执行后自动换行\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"ac06fadc95864174\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:34:11.279764Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:34:11.219561Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"print(\\\"helloworld_1\\\")\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"a7c5653fda871b4e\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \"helloworld_1\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 2\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"3. 定义一个字符串变量，变量名是 hello_world_text，变量值为 \\\"helloworld_2\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \" 变量命名遵循下划线命名法（小写字母+下划线），这是Python的推荐命名规范\\n\",\n",
    "    \" 在为字符串(在python中也可以直接称为变量)赋值时，程序都遵循将右边的赋给左边的的逻辑。\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"c37f43dea31149a9\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:34:12.459577Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:34:12.441618Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"hello_world_text = \\\"helloworld_2\\\"\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"754c860c0f546a7c\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 3\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"4. 打印上面定义的变量，输出变量存储的字符串值 \\\"helloworld\\\"\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"1495202d49fb68c\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:34:14.956084Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:34:14.929077Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"print(hello_world_text)\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"e66e57d0d66d97e8\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \"helloworld_2\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 4\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \" 5. 定义第一个字符串变量 hello，存储值为 \\\"Hello\\\"\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"d2e001b32dcbe5a5\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:55:24.369712Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:55:24.349149Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"hello = \\\"Hello\\\"\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"421f9696fc6264af\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 5\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"6. 定义第二个字符串变量 world，存储值为 \\\"World\\\"\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"65da71daa270b6cd\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:55:25.318080Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:55:25.294818Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"world = \\\"World\\\"\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"50db0d1620abb86a\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 6\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \" 7. 连接字符串\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"ea8fb87f47b79217\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:55:26.260438Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-01-02T06:55:26.216732Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"print(hello + \\\" \\\" + world)  # 方法一：在要连接的字符串之间写一个加号\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"{hello} {world}\\\")  # 方法二：使用f-string语法输出时，可以直接拼接由大括号包括的变量名\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(hello, world)  # 方式三：在两个要连接的字符串的名字之间添加一个逗号隔开\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"e88cbf85db4b5e5e\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
